-1|0@pics^1438698691#ctr3u71:arbys_crapper$:If they are married they shouldn't need a storage unit. The storage units get gypped by single soldiers who store their stuff because they don't need a place to live while deployed and then forget to pay the bill. They are a business; not a charity. Most of them already give a military discount.
