2|0@pics^1438713764#ctrdxhe:ex_biloxian$:Forget to pay the bill, or ya know fraud protection deems an activity as fraudulent and can't contact the account holder because they are sweating their asses off in the desert with no internet and contact number. And if you were military then you should know that half the people who need storage units don't trust their families with their shit or their money and probably wasted all their shit on gear (or most likely beer and pizza) for deployment and can't afford to pay a storage unit outright. Worst case scenario, they come back still don't pay the company contacts the unit CO and then the military makes the dude in question pay. Basically this bullshit storage place is trying to bank off the fact that shit does happen and they can make some money from these unlucky fucks. But all in all if a shady place like this exists then fuck it don't store your shit there. One last thing, just because they are married it doesn't mean that they live with their wives. A lot of times they will rent a place with the BAH and their wives are living at home or at college. And it would be easier to store your shit in the area that you are planning on moving back into than move it halfway across the country.
